description=Chinese fork of ZafxyrAgent. Local AI agent for rooted Android (KernelSU/Magisk/APatch). UI automation tools (screen/tap/swipe/key/text/screenshot) plus shell, file ops and reminders, so it can actually operate apps instead of only launching them. OpenAI-compatible / Gemini. Set the API key in the chat UI or /data/adb/aiagent/config.json.
